# With no planeswalker anywhere, Dedicated Commons enters tapped (CR 614.1c) - the land itself is not a planeswalker - so it cannot be
# tapped for mana that turn (refused), and on Bot1's next turn it untaps and taps for {R}, the other of its two colors.

[Bot1 Deck]
Dedicated Commons
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Dedicated Commons.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dedicated Commons.Tapped = true
